{"unit_id":"melt502__dsh-hotkey#card-zh","repo":"melt502/dsh-hotkey","commit":"35970904311b1beba8bf5ff1402a413b6fe196d7","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-hotkey（DSH 插件，网页客户端）：为 DSH Desktop 工作台增加可自定义的键盘快捷键。它通过浏览器端插件捕获按键，并在设置页加入快捷键编辑面板。主要功能包括切换侧边栏和面板、打开文件与 Git 标签、新建工作区或会话、在审批卡片出现时确认或拒绝，以及重新绑定、禁用、检测冲突和导入导出键位。适合希望用键盘操作 DSH 工作台的用户。无需 API Key；部分侧边栏和识图动作需要相应的 DSH 插件。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:18-25","lib/client.js:740-765","lib/client.js:1123-1208"]}
{"unit_id":"melt502__dsh-hotkey#card-en","repo":"melt502/dsh-hotkey","commit":"35970904311b1beba8bf5ff1402a413b6fe196d7","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-hotkey adds customizable keyboard shortcuts and a Settings editor to the DSH Desktop web workbench. Open panels, Files or Git, create sessions, and respond to visible approval cards. Rebind or disable actions, detect conflicts, and import or export keymaps. No API key is needed.","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:18-25","lib/client.js:740-765","lib/client.js:1123-1208"]}
