{"unit_id":"melt502__dsh-hotkey#feature-1","repo":"melt502/dsh-hotkey","commit":"35970904311b1beba8bf5ff1402a413b6fe196d7","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-hotkey 的功能「工作台快捷操作」：用键盘切换侧边栏和面板、打开文件或 Git 标签、新建工作区与会话。按默认组合键触发，也可在设置中重新绑定。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:740-765","lib/client.js:1159-1172"]}
{"unit_id":"melt502__dsh-hotkey#feature-2","repo":"melt502/dsh-hotkey","commit":"35970904311b1beba8bf5ff1402a413b6fe196d7","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-hotkey 的功能「快捷键编辑与备份」：设置页列出动作和键位，支持录制新组合、禁用或恢复默认，并显示冲突状态；还可将键位配置导出为 JSON 或导入。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:1159-1172","lib/client.js:1184-1208","lib/core.mjs:152-190"]}
{"unit_id":"melt502__dsh-hotkey#feature-3","repo":"melt502/dsh-hotkey","commit":"35970904311b1beba8bf5ff1402a413b6fe196d7","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-hotkey 的功能「审批快捷键」：当可见审批卡片包含确认或拒绝按钮时，可用 Enter 或 Esc 执行对应操作；没有匹配卡片时按键保留给 DSH 原有行为。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:386-465","lib/client.js:758-759","lib/client.js:957-977"]}
{"unit_id":"melt502__dsh-hotkey#feature-4","repo":"melt502/dsh-hotkey","commit":"35970904311b1beba8bf5ff1402a413b6fe196d7","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-hotkey 的功能「面板键盘导航」：在展开的右侧面板中用上下方向键移动焦点，再按 Enter 点击当前按钮；焦点位于面板外的输入框时不会接管导航键。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:909-947"]}
{"unit_id":"melt502__dsh-hotkey#feature-5","repo":"melt502/dsh-hotkey","commit":"35970904311b1beba8bf5ff1402a413b6fe196d7","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-hotkey 的功能「识图模式切换」：按 Ctrl+Alt+V 查找可见且可用的识图切换按钮并点击。此动作依赖提供该按钮的 dsh-vision-router 插件。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:495-508","lib/client.js:749"]}
{"unit_id":"melt502__dsh-hotkey#caveat-1","repo":"melt502/dsh-hotkey","commit":"35970904311b1beba8bf5ff1402a413b6fe196d7","type":"caveat","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-hotkey 使用设置服务保存键位，并通过 same-origin 请求调用桌面终端打开接口；无需额外 API Key。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:807-835","lib/client.js:544-564"]}
